-- A definition that boolean-rules.l4 imports: it refuses to answer for a
-- person who is not insured. A file of the agreement corpus with no
-- "agreement:" line is read only by the files that import it.

GIVEN person IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person is insured` person MEANS
    IF person THEN TRUE
    ELSE REFUSE "insurance is not modelled"
